<title>USA: U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Jan 2.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Jan 2.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said it will auction $19.25 billion of 52-week bills on January 2 to raise $350 million as $18.910 billion of 52-week bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued Jan 9 and mature Jan 8, 1998.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the bills will be 9127944Q4.</p>
